CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FA prison officer who had an
OL,8,Finappropriate relationship with a drug
OL,9,Fdealer who styled himself as the
OL,10,F"Latvian Pablo Escobar" has been
OL,11,Fjailed for eight months.
OL,13,FJahvine Kwamba, who was working at HMP
OL,14,FFosse Way in Leicestershire when she
OL,15,Fbegan a relationship with prisoner
OL,16,FRoberts Sokolovs.
OL,18,FShe initiated contact with him 1,367
OL,19,Ftimes while he was at the category C
OL,20,Fprison between 24 February and 3 June
OL,21,F2024, Leicester Crown Court heard.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@WO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FSokolovs was imprisoned for drug-
OL,8,Frelated matters in 2022 due to his
OL,9,Finvolvement in a county lines drug
OL,10,Fring called the Jimmy Line, between
OL,11,FSkelmersdale in Lancashire and Lincoln.
OL,13,FKwamba, 21, from Doncaster in South
OL,14,FYorkshire, was arrested in July 2024
OL,15,Fand previously pleaded guilty to two
OL,16,Fcounts of misconduct in a public
OL,17,Foffice.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FAt a sentencing hearing in Leicester
OL,8,Fon Friday, prosecution counsel Rawaid
OL,9,FJaved said sexually explicit
OL,10,Fphotographs and messages were sent
OL,11,Fbetween the pair on Snapchat after
OL,12,FSokolovs was sent to an immigration
OL,13,Fremoval centre at Gatwick Airport in
OL,14,FJune 2024.
OL,16,FBecause he was deported to Latvia in
OL,17,FNovember that year, Sokolovs was never
OL,18,Finterviewed about his relationship
OL,19,Fwith Kwamba.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FKwamba denies there was any physical
OL,8,Fsexual contact between the pair, which
OL,9,Fthe prosecution is "sceptical" about,
OL,10,Fthe court heard.
OL,12,FKwamba also received five payments
OL,13,Ffrom Sokolovs' mother Zita Sokolova,
OL,14,F53, totalling #1,495 between 18 March
OL,15,Fand 2 July 2024, while 18 payments
OL,16,Ftotalling #4,665 were sent to her in
OL,17,Fthe same period by his 20-year-old
OL,18,Fsister Venera Sokolova.
OL,26,@qD@TOUqD@^O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FKwamba sent seven payments, totalling
OL,8,F#660, to his sister between 27 March
OL,9,Fand 1 July 2024.
OL,11,FMr Javed said there were "no obvious
OL,12,Fpatterns" to the transactions, and
OL,13,Fwhen Kwamba first received a payment
OL,14,Fof #500 from Zita Sokolova in March
OL,15,F2024, she spent it on food and
OL,16,Fclothing and did not transfer it.
OL,26,@sD@ZOUtD@IO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FSam Ponniah, defending Kwamba, who was
OL,8,F19 at the time of the offences, said
OL,9,Fshe had shown "significant levels of
OL,10,Fnaivety and immaturity" and had been
OL,11,F"well in over her head" when she was
OL,12,Fput in charge of 64 prisoners despite
OL,13,Fbeing a prison officer for around four
OL,14,Fmonths.
OL,16,FHe said: "She speaks about the fact
OL,17,Fwhen she first got this job, being
OL,18,Faway from home, she was in an area she
OL,19,Fwas unfamiliar with and living by
OL,20,Fherself.
OL,26,@qD@OOUrD@WO]sD@AOUsD@WO]xD@JOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,F"She has real and substantiated
OL,8,Fremorse for her actions, it is clear
OL,9,Ffrom her letter that one of the things
OL,10,Fthat weighs heavily on her is ruining
OL,11,Fa job she thought she was doing well
OL,12,Fat... she knows she has thrown that
OL,13,Fall away."
OL,15,FMr Ponniah said Kwamba now works at a
OL,16,Fcar rental company.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@JO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FThe hearing was told Venera Sokolova
OL,8,Fwas in contact with her brother while
OL,9,Fhe was in prison 191 times, while his
OL,10,Fmother was in contact with him 33
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,13,FSokolovs' mother and sister, both from
OL,14,FSkelmersdale, previously pleaded
OL,15,Fguilty to transmitting or causing the
OL,16,Ftransmission of an image by electronic
OL,17,Fcommunications from inside HMP Fosse
OL,18,FWay between February 24 and June 3
OL,19,F2024.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FIn a voluntary police interview in
OL,8,FNovember 2024, Zita Sokolova said she
OL,9,Fwould send her son money while he was
OL,10,Fin prison, could not say when she
OL,11,Ffound out Kwamba was a prison officer,
OL,12,Fand said her son told her Kwamba was
OL,13,Fgoing to "help him".
OL,15,FIn her interview the same day, Venera
OL,16,FSokolova said she knew Kwamba to be
OL,17,Fher brother's girlfriend but did not
OL,18,Fknow she was a prison officer and was
OL,19,Fasked to contact her by her brother.
OL,26,@uD@JOUuD@SO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FZita Sokolova was given a four-month
OL,8,Fprison sentence suspended for one year
OL,9,Fand ordered to pay #400 costs.
OL,11,FVenera Sokolova was given a 12-month
OL,12,Fcommunity order with a requirement to
OL,13,Fattend 15 probation appointments.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FAddressing all three defendants in the
OL,8,Fdock, Judge Timothy Spencer KC said:
OL,9,F"This case strikes at the heart of any
OL,10,Ffunctioning criminal justice system,
OL,11,Fincluding a functioning prison system,
OL,12,Fwhere those running a prison can have
OL,13,Fsome confidence that discipline and
OL,14,Fgood order is maintained and not
OL,15,Fcontinually undermined.
OL,26,@qD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,F"You, in your different ways, have all
OL,8,Fcontributed to the undermining of that
OL,9,Fsystem of law and order and each of
OL,10,Fyou have struck at the heart of the
OL,11,Fmaintenance of law and order in this
OL,12,Fcountry."
OL,14,FSentencing Kwamba, who covered her
OL,15,Fface as she entered the court building
OL,16,Fto avoid reporters, the judge said she
OL,17,Fhad exposed herself to risk of
OL,18,Fblackmail and coercion.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@IO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G12/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FHe said: "You had extensive training,
OL,8,Fit was drummed into you the importance
OL,9,Fof high standards, professional
OL,10,Fcontact and maintaining integrity and
OL,11,Fnot exposing yourself in the way a
OL,12,Frelationship with a prisoner would.
OL,14,F"You knew from the start that any
OL,15,Fmoney at all, let alone over #6,000,
OL,16,Fwas exposing you to the same sort of
OL,17,Frisk I identified and that the
OL,18,Ftransfer of any amount was utterly
OL,19,Fwrong."
OL,26,@oD@JOUvD@AOU{D@GO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G13/14
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786198692
OL,3,CPrison officer jailed over
OL,4,Crelationship with 'Latvian Pablo
OL,5,CEscobar'
OL,7,FThe judge said he suspected Kwamba was
OL,8,F"pretty lonely and vulnerable",
OL,9,Fadding: "You were easy prey and easy
OL,10,Fpickings for Roberts, who obviously
OL,11,Fdecided he could exploit you.
OL,13,F"It's implicit that you were of good
OL,14,Fcharacter, not just in a sense of
OL,15,Fhaving no convictions but you did well
OL,16,Fin this job and it is a tragedy you
OL,17,Fhave thrown it all away."
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@^O]qD@IOUuD@AOUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G14/14
